1:51:22.050 --> 1:51:26.680
<i>♪I've got to keep on singin'♪</i>

1:51:27.180 --> 1:51:32.930
<i>♪Until you feel it
Just hold on♪</i>

1:51:33.600 --> 1:51:37.650
<i>♪Oh, the winds will change, I promise you♪</i>

1:51:37.940 --> 1:51:45.360
<i>♪My voice will see us through
To the end♪</i>

1:51:47.610 --> 1:51:50.670
<i>♪All of us searching♪</i>

1:51:50.840 --> 1:51:54.710
<i>♪Trying to find our happiness♪</i>

1:51:55.040 --> 1:52:01.000
<i>♪Our hands reach out and all we find is pain
Still we must try again♪</i>

1:52:01.420 --> 1:52:04.490
<i>♪What if that sorrow♪</i>

1:52:04.960 --> 1:52:08.830
<i>♪Becomes the strength that we're lookin' for?♪</i>

1:52:08.760 --> 1:52:14.600
<i>♪Then we can weather any storm that comes
Ready for what's in store♪</i>

1:52:15.520 --> 1:52:20.900
<i>♪When all is said and done
I hope that we will meet again♪</i>

1:52:21.900 --> 1:52:24.730
<i>♪At the ending♪</i>

1:52:27.240 --> 1:52:31.820
<i>♪Let me keep on living this waking dream♪</i>

1:52:32.320 --> 1:52:38.160
<i>♪There's no waking me
Let's dream on♪</i>

1:52:38.660 --> 1:52:42.840
<i>♪I see something far ahead of me♪</i>

1:52:42.960 --> 1:52:47.630
<i>♪A path that's waiting for me
Just beyond♪</i>

1:52:47.760 --> 1:52:52.390
<i>♪I'll always be here singin'♪</i>

1:52:52.890 --> 1:52:58.680
<i>♪Until you feel it
Just hold on♪</i>

1:52:59.310 --> 1:53:03.440
<i>♪Oh, my voice will be the wind that fills♪</i>

1:53:03.610 --> 1:53:11.030
<i>♪Your sails so you can still
Carry on♪</i>

1:53:35.760 --> 1:53:40.270
<i>♪I've got to keep on dreamin'♪</i>

1:53:40.850 --> 1:53:46.820
<i>♪Never surrenderin'
Go on♪</i>

1:53:47.270 --> 1:53:51.570
<i>♪Oh and even if I disappear♪</i>

1:53:51.780 --> 1:53:56.030
<i>♪My song will still ring out
For you to hear♪</i>

1:53:56.330 --> 1:54:00.910
<i>♪I have got to keep on singin'♪</i>

1:54:01.460 --> 1:54:07.290
